COMMENT
SP19 ON tree limit: the Hardwood stand's 94 records repeated 62 times
(5,828 records, each at 1/62 of its density) against ON's 6,000-record
storage, so growth, mortality, dead records and compression run near the
limit. ONLimit.db is generated by the makefile from FVSDataHardwood.db.
END

STDIDENT
ONLimit

ECHOSUM

DATABASE
DSNin
ONLimit.db
StandSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_StandInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'LD3001'
EndSQL
TreeSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_TreeInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'LD3001'
EndSQL
End

TIMEINT                      5
NUMCYCLE           4
THINBBA         2014        15

DATABASE
DSNOut
ONLimitOut.db
Summary
END

PROCESS
STOP
